@DaveCTurner I upgraded one data node and 3 other nodes threw errors and disconnected
I shut down the data node, wiped it of data and rolled it back to version 6.8.4 and its just reallocating shards now as there's a fair amount of data.

I was wondering if an upgrade to an earlier version of 7.x before then upgrading again to 7.6.2 would avoid the issue.  Otherwise I am going to try and reproduce the problem offline.
